ule's or class's namespace, else a function's fast locals"] [709 1 "// and cells as a new dict (PEP 667's snapshot)."] [752 1 "// builtinDir is dir(): the scope's names, or an object's __dir__() sorted (PY5c's lookup); without a"] [753 1 "// __dir__, a module's namespace, a type's and its bases', an object's type's and its __dict__'s."] [776 3 "// the object's __dir__ (object's, type's, module's, a class's own: PY5c's), its result sorted"] [877 1 "// roundFloat is float.__round__ (Objects/floatobject.c's double_round): to an int, ties to even, without"] [878 1 "// ndigits; else the correctly rounded value at ndigits decimal places (round-half-even on the exact decimal"] [879 1 "// value, as dtoa's mode 3), negative ndigits rounding to tens, hundreds ..."] [901 2 "// the exact decimal value of x, rounded half-even at n places after the point"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[20 48] [26 49] [36 47] [54 46] [60 48] [70 52] [85 41] [95 38] [104 41] [117 41] [133 52] [139 51] [171 31] [210 59] [214 32] [225 35] [252 46] [256 22] [266 28] [269 43] [299 34] [319 44] [374 45] [397 43] [411 43] [425 46] [442 46] [450 43] [468 45] [476 23] [490 39] [497 49] [500 50] [506 37] [535 25] [551 20] [551 28] [563 32] [590 40] [593 43] [608 37] [611 40] [624 37] [627 40] [633 34] [702 44] [730 37] [733 40] [739 31] [755 36] [758 39] [768 24] [777 54] [785 44] [802 47] [803 27] [821 38] [824 41] [834 44] [838 33] [847 32] [911 30]]} (go/file "builtins.go" :imports [


